From: Gooder24 <162874774+Gooder24@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:26:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Bridge Discord polls as MSC3381 polls

A poll becomes an org.matrix.msc3381.poll.start part with Discord's vote
counts (sk.karchi.discord.poll), replaced when Discord sends new counts
(at most once per 15 s). The poll result message becomes a poll.end and
Karchi's poll.response becomes his vote on Discord.
